RECORDED AUDIO — not in this repository at all
-----------------------------------------------
The recorded weapon, explosion and region-theme takes are absent from the tree
AND from its history. The service that generated them permits use but expressly
forbids redistributing, reselling or sublicensing the audio, which is precisely
what publishing them here would do.

Nothing is missing as a result. Every sound in the game has a full synthesis
path and that path is what you will hear:

  * src/audio/sfx.js  — every weapon, impact and explosion recipe falls through
    to synthesis when no recorded take is present.
  * src/audio/music.js — falls back to its generative score, per region.

A build that does have recorded takes places the mp3s in public/assets/{sfx,music}/
and adds public/assets/audio.json listing them; src/core/Assets.js reads that
manifest if it exists and skips the whole recorded path if it does not.

